Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790125199999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790121599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The largest single structure in the window is a range, not a trend: ~65 bars inside 1512.91-1974.46 plus 25 bars inside 2357.18-2680.00, i.e. two-sided overlap occupies most of the 120 bars.", "The push above 2357.18-2680.00 is a second attempt: the 1789084800000 bar spiked to 2680.00 and closed 2514.72, then price fell to 2358.62 before rallying, and first breakouts from ranges often fail.", "The last leg covers 2358.62 to 2850.00 (+20.8%) in six bars, and the 208.30-range and 445.69-range bars late in an extended move are climactic-sized; such bars can mark exhaustion rather than a fresh trend leg.", "The final bar 1790035200000 is an inside bar closing 2752.43 below the prior close, so no additional close above 2775.61/2850.00 yet confirms acceptance of the new high."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing lows across the window (1368.42 -> 1512.91 -> 1821.49/1821.69 -> 2357.18/2358.62) with higher swing highs (1845.09 -> 1974.46 -> 2771 -> 2850.00).", "Six consecutive higher closes (1789516800000-1789948800000) after the 2358.62 test of the range low, ending with a large bull trend bar closing 2775.61 above every prior high in the window.", "The 1787097600000 break of the 1512.91-1974.46 range was followed by a spike to 2771.00, so the current push repeats a visible breakout-consolidation-new-high sequence on this window.", "The 1789948800000 bar closes in the upper quarter of its 208.30 range, and the following bar holds inside it rather than reversing, so the breakout has not been rejected so far."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars (1779753600000-1790121599999): window opens at 2109.85, last close 2752.43, window low 1368.42, window high 2850.00.", "Bars from 1779753600000 to 1780704000000 declined from 2138.82 to 1368.42; the last three of that leg are wide bear bars (ranges 230.76, 237.00, 230.85) and the 1780704000000 bar closes 1568.55, well above its 1368.42 low.", "The 1780790400000 bar is a bull reversal bar: open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83, closing in its top quarter.", "About 65 bars (1781481600000-1787097599999) overlap two-sided between 1512.91 (low, 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high, 1785110400000), with repeated failed pushes at 1944.72, 1954.36, 1959.37, 1974.46 and repeated holds near 1821.49/1821.69.", "The 1787097600000 bar is a very large bull bar (1905.63-2293.80, close 2252.16) that breaks above 1974.46; the 1787270400000 bar has the widest range in the window (2325.31-2771.00 = 445.69) and closes 2515.30, mid-range.", "The next 25 bars (1787356800000-1789516799999) overlap between 2357.18 (low, 1788307200000) and 2680.00 (high, 1789084800000), with most bars between roughly 2394 and 2558; the bar at 1789430400000 tests 2358.62, holding just above 2357.18.", "Six consecutive higher closes follow (1789516800000-1789948800000), ending with a large bull trend bar (2641.70-2850.00, close 2775.61) that closes above every prior high in the window.", "The final bar (1790035200000) is an inside bar (2716.01-2776.18) closing 2752.43, just below the prior close 2775.61 and below the 2850.00 high."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Sell climax into 1368.42: three consecutive wide bear bars (1780531200000-1780790399999) end the decline from the window open, closed by the bull reversal bar at 1780790400000 (close 1687.83 near its high).", "end_time_ms": 1780876799999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780531200000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Broad two-sided trading range after the reversal: about 65 bars overlapping between 1512.91 and 1974.46, with repeated failed breaks of both edges (1944.72/1954.36/1959.37/1974.46 on top; 1821.49/1821.69/1512.91 below) and heavy bar overlap.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1781481600000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike out of the long range: bar at 1787097600000 (1905.63-2293.80) breaks 1974.46, and two bars later the 1787270400000 bar reaches 2771.00 with a mid-range close after a 445.69 range (climactic-sized).", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Trading range after the spike: 25 overlapping bars between 2357.18 and 2680.00, most of them inside roughly 2394-2558; a 2680.00 spike on 1789084800000 closes back at 2514.72 and price returns to 2358.62 on 1789430400000.", "end_time_ms": 1789516799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Current bull leg: higher low at 2358.62 (1789430400000) held above the range low, then six consecutive higher closes and a large bull trend bar (1789948800000) to a new window high 2850.00; the last bar is an inside pause bar.", "end_time_ms": 1790121599999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850.00, or a pullback holding above the 2680.00-2700.00 breakout area followed by a new high, keeps the breakout-spike bull read.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2557.46 (the 1787788800000 range high) puts price inside the 2357.18-2680.00 range and shifts the read toward trading-range.", "Loss of the higher low at 2357.18-2358.62 turns directional pressure from bull to at least balanced and makes 2771-2850.00 a possible failed-breakout high.", "Repeated overlapping bars with deepening pullbacks that stay below 2775-2850.00 would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790107199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bar 112 has a 126.85 upper tail and closes 2723.15, below its 2754.03 midpoint, a weak close for a 191.94-range spike bar and a possible buy-climax/exhaustion signature.", "Bars 113-120 overlap heavily, none closes above 2775.61, and the latest high 2804.59 is a lower high versus 2850, so the immediate eight-bar structure is genuinely two-sided rather than trending.", "This window shows two prior vertical spikes that were fully retraced: bar 53 high 2680 preceded a 321.38 drop to 2358.62, and bar 73 high 2609.02 (a marginal new high over 2607.62) preceded a 250.40 sell-off, so spike-and-fail is a repetitive behavior here.", "The whole window contains two long range sections (42 bars in 2411.04-2537.57 and roughly 20 bars in 2440-2610), so the trend component is interleaved with substantial rotation rather than a clean one-way market."], "evidence_for": ["Net window change is strongly upward (open 2391.63 to close 2749.43) and the window high 2850 was set only 9 bars before the end, so the dominant direction over the supplied window is up.", "Higher swing lows since 2358.62 (2384.29, 2435.71, 2569.80, 2658.06, 2716.01) with matching higher highs (2585.50, 2643.52, 2700, 2850) satisfy the standard bull trend progression on this window.", "The up-leg contains genuine spike bars closing near their highs (bar 95 close 2578.60 vs high 2585.50; bar 96 close 2636.28 vs high 2643.52; bar 112 broke above the 2700 equal highs), not just overlapping drift.", "The current pullback held: bar 117 low 2716.01 is above the 2700.00 breakout zone and none of bars 113-120 closed below bar 112's 2658.06 low, so the last pause has not yet damaged the trend structure.", "The earlier mid-trend pause (bars 97-106, 2568.16-2646.36) resolved upward with bars 107-112, showing this window's pattern of pause-then-continuation within the bull leg."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars from 1788379200000 to 1790107199999: open 2391.63 -> close 2749.43 (+357.80, about +15.0%), highest high 2850 (bar 112, 1789977600000), lowest low 2358.62 (bar 78, 1789488000000).", "Bars 1-10 rallied from 2377.88 to 2537.57 (bar 10 high), with bar 5 (open 2407.48, high 2509.15, close 2506.79) as a wide bull spike closing near its high.", "Bars 11-52 (1788523200000-1789127999999) were a 42-bar trading range between 2411.04 (bar 47 low) and 2537.57 (bar 10 high), with repeated 2527-2537 highs failing (bar 11 low 2436.73, bar 21 high 2527.29, bar 26 high 2528.80).", "Bar 53 (open 2457.12, high 2680, low 2444.19, close 2555.52) spiked out of that range, closing 111.33 above its low but leaving a 124.48 upper tail.", "Bars 54-78 formed a near-double top: bar 54 high 2607.62 and bar 73 high 2609.02, with bar 73 (open 2540.11, close 2514.07) closing near its low, followed by a bear leg to 2358.62 (bar 78), 250.40 below 2609.02.", "Since bar 78 the sequence is higher highs and higher lows: lows 2384.29 (bar 83), 2435.71 (bar 89), 2569.80 (bar 104), 2658.06 (bar 112), 2716.01 (bar 117); highs 2585.50 (bar 95), 2643.52 (bar 96), 2700 (bars 100 and 110, equal highs), 2850 (bar 112), 2804.59 (bar 115).", "Bull spike bars close near their highs in the up-leg: bar 95 (2507.15->2578.60, low 2495.82), bar 96 (2579.97->2636.28, low 2578.44), and bar 112 (open 2658.81, low 2658.06, high 2850, close 2723.15).", "Bar 112 is a 191.94-range bar with a 126.85 upper tail and a close 30.88 below its 2754.03 midpoint, i.e. a wide spike bar with a weak close.", "Bars 113-120 (1789992000000-1790107199999) all trade inside bar 112's range: highs 2795, 2770.03, 2804.59, 2776.18, 2741.20, 2752.61, 2761.62, 2761.63; lows 2718.09, 2734.22, 2759.63, 2727.22, 2716.01, 2722.76, 2722.62, 2729.14; closes 2754.31, 2760.51, 2775.61, 2738.87, 2724.95, 2740.20, 2742.31, 2749.43.", "The eight-bar pullback low 2716.01 (bar 117) holds above the 2700.00 equal-high breakout zone, so the last pause has not retraced into the prior consolidation (2568.16-2646.36 in bars 97-106) and no bar has closed below 2658.06 (bar 112 low).", "No bar since 2850 has exceeded the prior high; the latest high 2804.59 (bar 115) is a lower high and the final bar 120 (open 2742.31, high 2761.63, low 2729.14, close 2749.43) sits mid-range, not at a boundary, so no active boundary test is in progress."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "42-bar trading range between 2411.04 (bar 47 low) and 2537.57 (bar 10 high); repeated pushes to 2527-2537 were rejected and overlap was heavy.", "end_time_ms": 1789127999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2537.57"}, {"description": "Bull spike bar 53 broke the ~2530 range top and closed at 2555.52 with a 124.48 upper tail; no follow-through above 2607.62.", "end_time_ms": 1789142399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2444.19", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Failed breakout / near-double top: bar 54 high 2607.62 and bar 73 high 2609.02, with bar 73 closing 2514.07 near its low, then a bear leg to 2358.62 (bar 78).", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789142400000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Mid-trend pause in bars 97-106 between 2568.16 (bar 106 low) and 2646.36 (bar 99 high); it resolved upward via bars 107-112.", "end_time_ms": 1789955999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789761600000, "upper_boundary": "2646.36"}, {"description": "Bull leg from 2358.62 (bar 78 low) to 2850 (bar 112 high) with higher highs 2585.50, 2643.52, 2700, 2850 and higher lows 2435.71, 2569.80, 2658.06; two spike bursts (bars 95-96 and bars 107-112), pullbacks shallow relative to the spikes.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Eight bars (113-120) fully contained inside bar 112's range (2658.06-2850), overlapping small ranges between 2716.01 (bar 117 low) and 2804.59 (bar 115 high), no new high, closes 2724.95-2775.61.", "end_time_ms": 1790107199999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2804.59 followed by a bar closing above 2850 (acceptance above the spike high) would confirm trend resumption and raise always-in relevance.", "Bull-with-pause: continued two-sided trading inside 2716.01-2804.59 with no close below 2716.01 keeps the bull-trend read but leaves the phase channel/range ambiguous.", "Trend damage: consecutive closes below 2716.01 and then below 2658.06 (bar 112 low) would create a lower low out of the spike bar and shift the read toward a range or a top reversal, with 2568.16-2646.36 as the next reference zone.", "Structural break: a loss of 2569.80 (bar 104 low) would break the higher-low sequence and move the classification toward transition-unclear or trading-range.", "If the eight-bar range expands without any new high while bars grow in range and overlap, the phase shifts toward range and directional pressure toward balanced."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2457.2", "close_time_ms": 1789696799999, "high": "2458.47", "low": "2445.26", "open": "2446.89", "open_time_ms": 1789693200000, "volume": "1825586.474"}, {"close": "2463", "close_time_ms": 1789700399999, "high": "2